 "findings": [
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "★二次型逐元对 $n^2\\,\\mathrm{diag}(2,1,2/3)$，$n$ = 1 · 2 · 3 最劣 5.6e-15",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-energy-fluid-high-beta/criterion/1",
   "measured_deviation": 5.625e-15,
   "bound": "upper",
   "deviation_literal": "极化取 3×3，加两组 ξ 直接对 (12.147)：最劣相对 **5.625e-15**",
   "verdict": "pass",
   "caveat": [
    "★**是数值闭合，不是符号推导**：被积函数在 $\\rho$ 上是多项式、在 θ 上是三角多项式，Gauss 16 点 × 梯形 32 点对它**精确**，所以残差只剩舍入。判据说「差恒为零」，这里的「零」是机器精度的零；上游用 SymPy 做过符号那一步，本仓没有。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "fyo:ComparisonFinding",
   "title": "(12.142) 逐点 < 1e-15（零极向场那条完整路径也走过）；(12.143) 在非多项式 $U=\\sin r\\,e^{2i\\theta}$ 上 1.3e-14",
   "criterion": "benchmark/records/mhd-energy-fluid-high-beta/criterion/2",
   "measured_deviation": 1.27e-14,
   "bound": "upper",
